# ================= markdown 提交范围 =================
# 默认不提交任何 md, 只白名单"已发布的文档真正引用到"的那些 ——
# 这样 README 里不会出现死链, 又不会把没打算公开的稿子带出去。
# 注意: .gitignore 不支持行尾注释, 注释必须单独成行。
*.md

# 入口 README(各包 / 各目录)
!README.md

# 被 README 引用的文档:
#   competition.md                 赛题细则(定稿版)
#   web.md                         赛事总则与赛题细则链接
#   design/规则校核报告.md          规则校核与实测依据
#   design/赛事设计指南.md          怎么从零把比赛办起来
#   docs/JAKA-Mini2-参数速查.md     官方参数 vs URDF 实测
#   docs/真机部署.md                决赛真机部署指南
#   docs/Gazebo仿真.md              Gazebo 显示层(可选)的开关与坑
#   docs/WHEELTEC柔性机械爪.md       末端柔性爪的 STEP→URDF、驱动与可达性结论
#   dual_arm_demo/ROLES.md         双臂演示的角色说明
#   extras_linkerhand/doc/Topic-Reference.md
#   jaka_ros2/jaka_ros2_documentation.md
#   jaka_ros2/jaka_ros2_documentation-中文版.md
#   jaka_ros2/release_notes.md
!competition.md
!web.md
!design/规则校核报告.md
!design/赛事设计指南.md
!docs/JAKA-Mini2-参数速查.md
!docs/真机部署.md
!docs/Gazebo仿真.md
!docs/WHEELTEC柔性机械爪.md
!dual_arm_demo/ROLES.md
!extras_linkerhand/doc/Topic-Reference.md
!jaka_ros2/jaka_ros2_documentation.md
!jaka_ros2/jaka_ros2_documentation-中文版.md
!jaka_ros2/release_notes.md
!perception/track1_sim/README.md
!perception/track2_yolo/README.md
!design/腕部Gemini305.md

# 仍然不提交:
#   competition-初稿-已归档.md     已被定稿取代, 发布只会让人照错的规则做
#   extras_linkerhand/README_CN.md 无人引用, 与 README.md 内容重复

# ================= 构建产物 =================
# 这两个目录里大量符号链接指向本机绝对路径(/home/<user>/...),
# 提交上去别人 clone 下来是坏的, 而且体积 148MB。
# 用之前跑一次: bash setup/build.sh
jaka_ros2/build/
jaka_ros2/install/
jaka_ros2/log/

# ================= Python =================
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# ================= 杂项 =================
*.xwd
*.swp
.DS_Store

# ================= 文档生成 =================
design/.fontcache/

design/.vendor/

# MuJoCo 本地虚拟环境，不提交
mujoco/.venv/

# ================= 赛道二视觉 =================
# 虚拟环境、采集的图、训练曲线和权重都不提交。
# 类别编号在 perception/track2_yolo/classes.py, 不要把绝对路径写进仓库。
perception/track2_yolo/.venv/
perception/track2_yolo/runs/
perception/track2_yolo/weights/
perception/track2_yolo/dataset/incoming/
perception/track2_yolo/dataset/images/
perception/track2_yolo/dataset/labels/
perception/track2_yolo/dataset/track2.yaml
perception/track2_yolo/dataset/**/*.cache
perception/track2_yolo/**/*.pt

# 基础组仿真练习数据。脚本会重新采集，图片和权重不进 git。
perception/track1_sim/dataset/incoming/*
!perception/track1_sim/dataset/incoming/.gitkeep
perception/track1_sim/dataset/images/
perception/track1_sim/dataset/labels/
perception/track1_sim/runs/
perception/track1_sim/**/*.pt
perception/track1_sim/dataset/track1.local.yaml
perception/track1_sim/pose_daemon
# 预览节点写出的图，不进仓库。
design/gemini305_preview/
design/track1_recognize/
